  abstract = {Summary: As the most successful artificial intelligence product, ChatGPT is becoming a breakthrough point for global technological innovation. This article comprehensively discusses and analyzes the application of ChatGPT technology in command information systems, discusses its advantages and development deployment in command information systems, and looks forward to the future application of ChatGPT technology.},
